### Call Android Activity onPause

Source: https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/Instrumentation

Invokes the onPause method of an Android Activity. This method is available from API level 1 and is used to handle the activity pausing.

```java
public void callActivityOnPause (Activity activity)
```

