### setOnFrameAvailableListener(listener)

Source: https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/SurfaceTexture

Registers a callback to be invoked when a new image frame becomes available. The callback may be called on an arbitrary thread.

```APIDOC
## setOnFrameAvailableListener(listener)

### Description
Registers a callback to be invoked when a new image frame becomes available to the SurfaceTexture. The callback may be called on an arbitrary thread, so it is not safe to call `updateTexImage()` without first binding the OpenGL ES context to the thread invoking the callback.

